            "reviewBody": "This is an excellent recipe. I received lots of compliments. As I couldn't find any \"key limes\" I substituted 2/3 cup fresh squeezed lime juice with 1/3 cup fresh squeezed lemon juice which made it taste more authentic. Might be a tad on the sweet side. Next time I'll reduce the volume of sweetened condensed milk.",
